# ArenaChillPrep — local development environment
#
# This file is NOT committed to git (see .gitignore). Copy it to .env and fill
# in the paths for YOUR machine. All scripts and docs that need a path read
# these variables instead of hardcoding them.
#
# The WoW TBC Anniversary client folder that contains the addons you develop
# against (the folder where ArenaChillPrep is installed for in-game testing).
# Example: addons_path_anniversary=G:\games\World of Warcraft\_anniversary_\Interface\AddOns
addons_path_anniversary=